# ADR-08 Segmented log, space reclamation and compression at relocation

Date: 2026-09-19, approach decided 2026-09-20
Author: Miguel Filipe
Status: draft. The approach is decided; sizes, thresholds and encodings are open until the workbench measures them. Nothing in it is implemented.
On-disk format: 4 (proposed)
Related: [ADR-01](ADR-01-LOG-STRUCTURED-BLOCK-DEVICE.md), [ADR-04](ADR-04-GROWABLE-THIN-PROVISIONED-FORMAT.md), [ADR-07](ADR-07-PAGED-MAPPING-AND-CACHE.md), [prior art review](papers/README.md), [workbench memo](TMD-WORKBENCH.md)
